[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-2026-university-of-antwerp-postgraduate-scholarship-in-human-rights-law-and-global-justice-fully-funded-in-belgium-286":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},286,"2026-university-of-antwerp-postgraduate-scholarship-in-human-rights-law-and-global-justice-fully-funded-in-belgium-286","2026 University Of Antwerp Postgraduate Scholarship In Human Rights Law And Global Justice: Fully Funded In Belgium","\u003Cp>The University of Antwerp has announced a call for applications for a full-time doctoral scholarship in the broad field of human rights law and global justice.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Antwerp Postgraduate Scholarship offers a fully funded full-time doctoral scholarship holder in the broad field of human rights law and global justice.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Antwerp Postgraduate Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: University of Antwerp\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Belgium\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ecocheques\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Internet-Connectivity Allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A Bicycle Allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A Full Reimbursement of Public Transport Costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 25, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Antwerp Postgraduate Scholarship 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Antwerp Postgraduate Scholarship offers the following benefits;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp> a doctoral scholarship for a period of two years. Following a positive evaluation, the scholarship can be renewed once for another two-year period.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Your monthly scholarship amount is calculated according to the \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.uantwerpen.be\u002Fen\u002Fjobs\u002Fwhat-do-we-offer\u002Fsalaries\u002F\">scholarship amounts \u003C\u002Fa>for doctoral scholarship holders on the pay scales for contract research staff (Dutch: \u003Cem>Bijzonder Academisch Personeel\u003C\u002Fem>, BAP).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>As a doctoral researcher, you will have access to a wide and varied range of courses and an \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Funiversity-of-antwerp-postgraduate-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>educational\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> credit through the Antwerp Doctoral School.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will receive ecocheques, Internet-connectivity allowance, and a bicycle allowance or a full reimbursement of public transport costs for commuting.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will do most of your work at the City Campus in a dynamic and stimulating working environment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Antwerp Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the University of Antwerp Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You hold a law degree, a master’s degree in law or in social \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Funiversity-of-antwerp-postgraduate-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>sciences\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> – in the latter case, with a demonstrated knowledge of and interest in human rights law (or you will have obtained it by the time you start work).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You submit a concise research proposal in English for the research you will be developing (see above). This focused proposal of 2 pages includes the following headings: problem statement, central research question, methodology and core bibliography. You pay attention to global justice and Global South dimensions. The proposal should allow you to successfully complete the PhD in 4 years.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You can demonstrate excellent study results, in particular in the broad area of human rights law. You substantiate this with a detailed overview of your study results (see ‘Want to apply?’).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You have an adequate command of English or Dutch to be able to provide teaching (support).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Your teaching competences are in line with the University of Antwerp’s \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.uantwerpen.be\u002Fen\u002Fabout-uantwerp\u002Forganisation\u002Fmission-and-vision\u002Fthree-core-tasks\u002Feducation\u002F\">educational vision\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Your research qualities are in line with the faculty and \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.uantwerpen.be\u002Fen\u002Fresearch\u002Fmanagement\u002F\">university research policies\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You are willing to apply for (additional) research funding.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You have a particular interest in scientific research in the field of hum\u003Cstrong>an rights law and global justice.\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>You combine a deep knowledge of the human rights law with a research interest in the global (South) context.\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>University of Antwerp Scholarship 2026 Required Documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the University of Antwerp Faculty of Law Scholarship 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>a motivation letter\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>a concise research proposal of 2 pages for the research you will be developing (see above)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>a detailed overview of your study grades\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>your (academic) CV\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for University of Antwerp Postgraduate Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the University of Antwerp Postgraduate Scholarship 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply through the University of Antwerp’s online job application platform\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.uantwerpen.be\u002Fen\u002Fjobs\u002Fvacancies\u002Facademic-staff\u002F?q=4429&amp;descr=Doctoral-scholarship-holder-in-the-broad-field-of-human-rights-law-and-global-justice\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.uantwerpen.be\u002Fen\u002Fjobs\u002Fvacancies\u002Facademic-staff\u002F?q=4429&amp;descr=Doctoral-scholarship-holder-in-the-broad-field-of-human-rights-law-and-global-justice\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-08 12:07:16",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-university-of-antwerp-postgraduate-scholarship-in-human-rights-law-and-global-justice-fully-funded-in-belgium\u002F6a26a2648ec477.99908277_screenshot 2026-06-08 115733.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-university-of-antwerp-postgraduate-scholarship-in-human-rights-law-and-global-justice-fully-funded-in-belgium\u002F6a26a2648ec477.99908277_screenshot%202026-06-08%20115733.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunit